lly offering perpetual futures on real-world assets including oil, silver, copper and gold.\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T13:57:00+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n    \"title\": \"Live markets: Yet another Iran peace deal and Mark Cuban sells his bitcoin\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/live-markets-bitcoin-s-flat-action-continues-as-spacex-ipo-nvidia-earnings-capture-news-cycle\",\n    \"desc\": \"Hyperliquid's HYPE is the outlier in crypto, rising 16.5% over the past 24 hours to a new record high.\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T13:51:11+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n    \"title\": \"Blockchain.com files with SEC for U.S. IPO\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/21/blockchain-com-files-confidential-paperwork-with-sec-for-u-s-ipo\",\n    \"desc\": \"The crypto financial services firm submitted a draft S-1 to the SEC as it explores a public listing amid renewed momentum in digital asset markets.\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T13:50:27+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n    \"title\": \"Bitcoin's long-term holder supply approaches record high, breaking multi-year downtrend\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/bitcoin-s-long-term-holder-supply-approaches-record-high-breaking-multi-year-downtrend\",\n    \"desc\": \"Long-term holder supply has surged by more than 2 million coins to 16.3 million BTC during the current bear market.\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T13:23:00+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n    \"title\": \"CoinDesk 20 performance update: Internet Computer drops 1.6%, leading index lower\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/coindesk-indices/2026/05/21/coindesk-20-performance-update-internet-computer-drops-1-6-leading-index-lower\",\n    \"desc\": \"Hedera (HBAR), down 1.3% from Wednesday, joined Internet Computer (ICP) as an underperformer.\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T13:16:12+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n    \"title\": \"Stablecoins retain the edge over tokenized money market funds, JPMorgan says\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/21/stablecoins-retain-the-edge-over-tokenized-money-market-funds-jpmorgan-says\",\n    \"desc\": \"The bank said tokenized money market funds account for only about 5% of the broader stablecoin universe despite offering yield.\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T12:49:17+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n    \"title\": \"It's not all HYPE: Privacy and quantum-resistant coins advance as bitcoin coasts\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/daybook-us/2026/05/21/it-s-not-all-hype-privacy-and-quantum-resistant-coins-surge-as-bitcoin-marks-time\",\n    \"desc\": \"Your day-ahead look for May 21, 2026\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T11:21:25+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n    \"title\": \"The $6 billion expiration countdown: Traders pile into $82,000 bitcoin calls ahead of May 29 expiry\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/bitcoin-caught-between-usd75-000-max-pain-and-usd80-000-call-wall-ahead-of-usd6-25-billion-expiry\",\n    \"desc\": \"Deribit’s bitcoin open interest has overtaken BlackRock’s IBIT as traders brace for a showdown between $75K max pain and $80K call positioning.\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T10:53:05+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n    \"title\": \"HYPE leads crypto rebound as traders position for volatility breakout\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/hype-leads-crypto-rebound-as-traders-position-for-volatility-breakout\",\n    \"desc\": \"Bitcoin and ether stabilized as derivatives activity rebounded, HYPE rose for a fifth straight day and options traders positioned for a breakout.\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T10:52:57+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n    \"title\": \"A crypto whale has made a $224,000 bet that XRP's price stays perfectly flat