37+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinTelegraph\",\n    \"title\": \"5 crypto firms wind down this week amid ongoing market slump\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/5-crypto-firms-wind-down-this-week-amid-ongoing-market-slump?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\",\n    \"desc\": \"    Fantasy.top, Everclear and ZERO Network announced they were winding down on Thursday, adding to a growing list of crypto companies that have closed this year. \",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-22T03:59:57+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinTelegraph\",\n    \"title\": \"Bitcoin liquidity balance hints at developing rally toward $80K\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-liquidity-imbalance-eyes-a-sharp-rally-to-80k-next-heres-why?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\",\n    \"desc\": \"    Data show Bitcoin futures traders are pursuing overhead short positions, raising the chance of a rally to $80,000. \",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-22T00:34:56+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinTelegraph\",\n    \"title\": \"Bitcoin longs soar despite weak US macroeconomic data: Is $82K BTC next?\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-longs-soar-despite-weak-us-macroeconomic-data-is-82k-btc-next?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\",\n    \"desc\": \"    Data shows Bitcoin traders cutting short positions and going long despite concerning US macroeconomic data emerging. Is a rally toward $82,000 next? \",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T23:07:13+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CoinTelegraph\",\n    \"title\": \"Harvard dumps entire ETH position after just one quarter\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/harvard-dumps-entire-eth-position-one-quarter?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\",\n    \"desc\": \"    Harvard's endowment fund has become one of the latest high-profile holders to liqui