n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T23:36:54+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"BeInCrypto\",\n    \"title\": \"Cardano’s Science Coin Identity at Risk as Charles Hoskinson Warns of Research Collapse\",\n    \"link\": \"https://beincrypto.com/cardano-risk-hoskinson-research-vote/\",\n    \"desc\": \" Charles Hoskinson warns Cardano could lose its lab as Japanese dReps reject a 32.9 million ADA research proposal. \\n The post  Cardano&#8217;s Science Coin Identity at Risk as Charles Hoskinson Warns of Research Collapse  appeared first on  BeInCrypto . \",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T21:58:17+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"BeInCrypto\",\n    \"title\": \"10 Surprising Facts About Elon Musk’s $1 Trillion SpaceX IPO\",\n    \"link\": \"https://beincrypto.com/elon-musk-spacex-ipo-surprising-facts/\",\n    \"desc\": \" Elon Musk&#8217;s SpaceX filed for an initial public offering on Wednesday. The filing shows a $1 trillion pay package tied to founding a Mars colony, a surprise $45 billion compute deal with rival Anthropic, and the bundled inclusion of X and xAI in the listed entity. Here are 10 surprising facts \",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T20:59:49+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"BeInCrypto\",\n    \"title\": \"US-Iran Peace Deal Rumors Send Stocks Up $500 Billion as Oil Price Crashes\",\n    \"link\": \"https://beincrypto.com/us-iran-draft-peace-deal-stocks-oil-impact/\",\n    \"desc\": \" A leaked US-Iran draft deal added $500 billion to US stocks and pushed WTI oil below $96 as Bitcoin held firm. \\n The post  US-Iran Peace Deal Rumors Send Stocks Up $500 Billion as Oil Price Crashes  appeared first on  BeInCrypto . \",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T20:07:47+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"The Block\",\n    \"error\": \"HTTP Error 403: Forbidden\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CryptoSlate\",\n    \"title\": \"Why do Bitcoin traders care so much about the 200-day moving average?\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cryptoslate.com/why-bitcoin-traders-care-200-day-moving-average/\",\n    \"desc\": \" Bitcoin price reached $82,400 on May 20 and ran into a line on a chart. Up 37% from its April lows, BTC stalled at the 200-day moving average, pulled back to as low as $76,000, and left the market wondering what the rejection showed about the market's underlying structure. That line, a simple arith\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-22T06:00:51+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CryptoSlate\",\n    \"title\": \"World Liberty Financial rebound gives dormant WLFI holders an exit as AI Financial warns of survival risk\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cryptoslate.com/world-liberty-financial-wlfi-rebound-ai-financial-risk/\",\n    \"desc\": \" World Liberty Financial’s WLFI token is facing renewed scrutiny as the Donald Trump family-backed crypto project tries to rebuild demand and confidence after its recent slide to an all-time low. World Liberty Financial has responded with WLFI token burns, exchange integrations, and rewards programs\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T20:10:45+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CryptoSlate\",\n    \"title\": \"US lawmakers push new Strategic Bitcoin Reserve act to secure $25 billion federal stash\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cryptoslate.com/us-lawmakers-push-new-strategic-bitcoin-reserve-act-to-secure-25-billion-federal-stash/\",\n    \"desc\": \" A renewed push to solidify the United States’ foothold in the digital asset market emerged Thursday as lawmakers unveiled legislation to establish a formal strategic Bitcoin reserve and consolidate the federal government's multibillion-dollar cryptocurrency stockpile. Spearheaded by Representative \",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T19:05:23+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CryptoSlate\",\n    \"title\": \"Bitcoin ETF demand weakens despite CLARITY Act policy win\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cryptoslate.com/bitcoin-etf-demand-cracks-clarity-act-vote/\",\n    \"desc\": \" Washington just gave crypto one of its clearest policy wins of 2026. Bitcoin ETF demand cracked anyway. The Senate Banking Committee advanced H.R. 3633, the Digital Asset Market Clarity Act, by a 15-9 vote on May 14, sending the market-structure bill toward the Senate floor. CryptoSlate reported th\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T18:05:02+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CryptoSlate\",\n    \"title\": \"84% of BTC hashrate secured Bitcoin DeFi in Q1, but miners saw little fee upside\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cryptoslate.com/bitcoin-defi-rootstock-hashrate/\",\n    \"desc\": \" The 84.01% figure strengthens the BTCFi security case, but miner revenue and usage remain unresolved. \\n The post  84% of BTC hashrate secured Bitcoin DeFi in Q1, but miners saw little fee upside  appeared first on  CryptoSlate . \",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T16:10:20+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CryptoSlate\",\n    \"title\": \"Bitcoin quantum computing risk centers on major exchange wallets, Glassnode data shows\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cryptoslate.com/bitcoin-quantum-computing-risk-exchange-wallets/\",\n    \"desc\": \" Cryptocurrency exchanges are emerging as the clearest pressure point in Bitcoin’s long-running debate over quantum computing risk, sitting on millions of coins with publicly visible cryptographic keys. Bitcoin quantum risk begins with a fundamental feature of its transaction verification: public ke\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T14:15:18+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source\": \"CryptoSlate\",\n    \"title\": \"Hyperliquid price crosses $50 as HYPE ETFs outpace Bitcoin on adjusted inflows\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cryptoslate.com/hyperliquid-price-crosses-50-hype-etfs-bitcoin-flows/\",\n    \"desc\": \" Hyperliquid price crossed $50 as the first spot HYPE exchange-traded funds drew stronger early demand than Bitcoin products on a market-cap-adjusted basis, giving investors a regulated way to express exposure to one of crypto’s fastest-growing trading venues. Data from SoSoValue show the two HYPE f\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T12:55:46+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n  